l they found a place in the desert that seemed strange. There was grass, a great spring, and they were surrounded by desert. They thanked the gods, and 8 people took command and started building a home, little by little, slowly. These were Zaiz, Alana, Rollele, Arferyn, Godriel, Ohan, Zara, and Ahrhsan. Later, when the town was founded and built to give it its name, its descendants called it Zaragoza, taking the initial of each of the names of the founders, to create the name of their town. Now it is what it is now, a town far away and at the same time very close to civilization, between two big cities.
